      "content": "i appreciate that but... i really can't see those paths. like everyone keeps saying \"there are options\" but there aren't. not for me. i can't go home, my family would be devastated. i can't stay here legally without the student visa. i can't reapply - this was my final attempt. i keep running through it and every single option ends with me being humiliated or losing everything. i just feel so trapped. like i genuinely don't see what im supposed to do when there's literally no path that doesn't destroy me",
